window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I was sick of being the girl who ran so this time I stayed. For them. Hardin and Kaleb.</b></p> <p>But now, thanks to Aodhan, there's a target on my back.</p> <p>I thought I could trust him, but he threw me to the wolves. It doesn't matter what he's done to try to fix it; I should hate him. I should…but I can't.</p> <p>Until those closest to me are hurt and blood starts to spill in the streets.</p> <p>That's when I'll know what I'll have to do.</p> <p>It's time to summon a version of Becca Hart that can be just as ruthless as her enemies. If I can't, I don't think any of us will make it out alive.</p> <p>Ruthless Reign <i>completes the Kings of Kilborn Univeristy duet. It is a dark romance where the main character doesn't have to choose between love interests. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
